id=wfd_seccomp_fix
name=WFD Seccomp Loop Fix (experimental)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=trprkkk
description=EXPERIMENTAL. Adds gettimeofday to the seccomp policies of wfdvndservice and wfdhdcphalservice at boot. Works around the 5-second crash/restart loop seen when the vendor seccomp policy blocks gettimeofday. Verify the policy paths and format on your ROM first.
